{"id":"9c54640eb3282127","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-indiscernible-sequence.md","title":"Indiscernible Sequence","display":"df-indiscernible-sequence — Indiscernible Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-indiscernible-sequence","aliases":["17-df-indiscernible-sequence"],"display":"df-indiscernible-sequence — Indiscernible Sequence","depends_on":["[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-linear-order]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"definition compared in supplied OCR; local sequence formulation","source_section":"3.3","source_result":"Indiscernibles definition preceding Proposition 3.3.8","source_pages_print":[169],"source_pages_djvu":[185],"legacy_label":"17-df-2.4.1","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-indiscernible-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-indiscernible-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indiscernible-sequence — Indiscernible Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f12d30db6793ecd\" href=\"?note=3f12d30db6793ecd\" title=\"17-df-linear-order\">17-df-linear-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied OCR; local sequence formulation"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Indiscernibles definition preceding Proposition 3.3.8"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-2.4.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,&lt;)\">\\(\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,&lt;)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f12d30db6793ecd\" href=\"?note=3f12d30db6793ecd\" title=\"17-df-linear-order\">17-df-linear-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}\\)</span> 均显式携带该次序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_r=\\bar i(r)\">\\(i_r=\\bar i(r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_r=\\bar j(r)\">\\(j_r=\\bar j(r)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;n\">\\(r&lt;n\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,&lt;)\">\\((I,&lt;)\\)</span> (linear order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> (formulas in the variables <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (finite-tuple satisfaction from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>; for each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, the displayed variables are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;),\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;),\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (sets defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;)\n&amp;=\n\\{\\bar i\\in I^n:\\forall p,q&lt;n\\;(p&lt;q\\to\\bar i(p)&lt;\\bar i(q))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}(\\mathfrak{A})\n&amp;=\n\\bigl\\{a:I\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|:\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar i,\\bar j\\in\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;),\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\n\\varphi[a\\circ\\bar i]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\n\\varphi[a\\circ\\bar j]\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;)\n&amp;=\n\\{\\bar i\\in I^n:\\forall p,q&lt;n\\;(p&lt;q\\to\\bar i(p)&lt;\\bar i(q))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,&lt;}(\\mathfrak{A})\n&amp;=\n\\bigl\\{a:I\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|:\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar i,\\bar j\\in\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,&lt;),\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\n\\varphi[a\\circ\\bar i]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\n\\varphi[a\\circ\\bar j]\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is used only to select increasing tuples.  Thus the definition\nexpresses order indiscernibility over the empty parameter set and does not confuse\nthe carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> with the structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> in satisfaction.</p>\n<p>原书 §3.3 印刷 p.169（DjVu185）以有序子集定义不可分辨元；本地以任意序列记录该条件，并在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3765fb2168038a13\" href=\"?note=3765fb2168038a13\" title=\"17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski\">17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski</a> 中另加单射性以得到有序子集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"3f12d30db6793ecd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"3f12d30db6793ecd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,<)$，见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；$n\\in\\omega$。$\\operatorname{Inc}_n(I,<)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Ind}_{I,<}$ 均显式携带该次序；$i_r=\\bar i(r)$、$j_r=\\bar j(r)$，$r<n$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in the variables $x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}$, see [[17-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (finite-tuple sa